{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56252","headline":"宫词 · 花蘂夫人","name":"宫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨洒瑶阶花尽开，君王应是看花来。\n静凭雕栏浑忘倦，忽听笙簧殿外回。\n（见毛氏汲古阁本《花蘂夫人宫词》。\n转录自《开明书店廿周年纪念文集》所刊浦江清《花蘂夫人宫词考证》。\n浦云此诗他本俱无，未详来历。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"花蘂夫人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}